# Ship the synthetic seed fixture in the sdist (ADR 011, #57): the
# quick-start's sample corpus comes from the release artifact itself, so
# a stranger needs no checkout to run `plan generate --seed-dir`.
# Wheels are unaffected — MANIFEST.in only shapes the sdist.
graft tests/fixtures/seed
# Ship the first domain slice the same way (ADR 013, #59): the slice
# registry + excerpt come from the release artifact, so a stranger can
# run the slice with `plan generate --slice-dir` against the sdist tree.
graft data/slices
